        "Content": "Hume Auctioneers - We get the pick of the crop. \n\nTAKE AN EXCLUSIVE HUME VIRTUAL TOUR NOW. CLICK BELOW\n\nHume Auctioneers - We get the pick of the crop. \n\nSuperbly located in this prestigious development just off the Mountrath/Limerick Road and within walking distance of all amenities this 3-bedroom residence in showhouse condition offers great convenience. \n\nGraham developments: a renowned name in quality family homes, have chosen the best located site in Portlaoise for this unrivalled development. These breath-taking designer homes offer levels of quality style and finish seldom seen in today's market.\n\nMaryborough Village is now beautifully mature with attractive cul-de-sacs, tree lined avenues and cobbled squares. House buyers in Maryborough village can relax in the knowledge that this beautiful development is established as one of the leading addresses in Portlaoise with a magnificent respectable community celebrating a great choice of home.\n\nThis stunning home has been magnificently presented for sale and boasts many outstanding features.\n\nThe property is in pristine condition, spotlessly clean and has been meticulously prepared by its owner occupiers \n\nBoasting many fine features including gas central heating, pvc double glazed windows, attractive panelling, and a large rear garden with patio and lawns.\n\n The accommodation, comprises Sittingroom, kitchen/dining room, Guest WC , 3 bedrooms & bathroom. \n\nViewing of this excellent property highly recommended.\n\n BER C2.\nGround Floor\n\nEntrance Hall: \n\nSitting Room 5.00m x 3.17m \n\nKitchen/Dining Room 5.42m x 3.32m \n\nSeparate W.C. Tiled floor, w.c., w.h.b.. \n\nFirst Floor\nLanding: \n\nBedroom 1 4.20m x 3.12m \n\nBedroom 2 3.90m x 3.19m \n\nBedroom 3 3.34m x 2.38m \n\nBathroom 2.18m x 1.86m \n\nGarden Fully enclosed rear garden.\nFibre Broadband. Walking distance to schools, shops and all amenities"
